<Page
  title="About"
  heading="About bla5k"
  description="What bla5k is and why it exists."
>
  <p>
    <strong>bla5k</strong> is a hand-organized directory of the internet’s best tools,
    websites, and communities. The web is enormous and noisy — great resources are easy to
    miss. bla5k exists to cut through that noise with a clean, categorized reference you can
    actually navigate.
  </p>

  <h2>What you’ll find</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Carefully sorted categories, from AI tools to design, learning, and communities.</li>
    <li>A short, honest write-up for every entry — what it is and why it’s worth your time.</li>
    <li>An instant search so you can jump straight to what you need.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How entries are chosen</h2>
  <p>
    Every listing earns its place on usefulness alone. We add resources we’d genuinely
    recommend to a friend. The directory grows continually as we discover more of the web’s
    hidden gems.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Have a tool we should include, or spotted something out of date? We’d love to hear from
    you — head to the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.
  </p>

  <h2>Our policies</h2>
  <p>
    bla5k is built on transparency. Here are the policies that govern the site — how we
    handle your data, the rules for using bla5k, how copyright works, and how we’re
    supported:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> — how we collect, use, and protect your data.</li>
    <li><a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a> — the rules governing your use of bla5k.</li>
    <li><a href="/dmca/">DMCA &amp; Copyright Policy</a> — copyright and takedown procedure.</li>
    <li><a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate &amp; Advertising Disclosure</a> — how bla5k is supported.</li>
  </ul>
